  "bodyHash": "/dVLuqY8p48=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/forgeconfigapiport/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/forgeconfigapiport/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/forgeconfigapiport/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Forge Config API Port</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 是一个开发者库，它将 Forge 和 NeoForge 的配置系统引入其他模组加载器。它允许模组在 Fabric、Forge 和 NeoForge 之间使用熟悉的 Forge 或 NeoForge 风格配置，而无需维护独立的配置实现。📦</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">此模组面向模组开发者，并作为支持模组的依赖项。它并不允许 Forge 模组在 Fabric 上运行，也不提供任何加载器之间常规模组兼容性的支持。🔧</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">通过尽可能保留原始 API、包名和行为，该模组让维护多加载器项目以及在各平台之间共享配置代码变得更加容易。这有助于减少平台特定代码，并在支持的模组加载器之间保持配置处理的一致性。🔄</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/forgeconfigapiport/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📦 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">配置库：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">将 Forge 和 NeoForge 的配置系统引入其他模组加载器，同时保留其熟悉的 API。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔄 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">跨加载器配置支持：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">在 Fabric 和 NeoForge 上使用 Forge 配置，或在 Fabric 和 Forge 上使用 NeoForge 配置。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧩 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">无需重构：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">保留原始包名和类名，允许现有配置实现无需或只需少量代码更改即可移植。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏗️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">专为多加载器项目打造：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">在共享的通用模块中定义和注册配置，而无需维护独立的平台特定实现。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">♻️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">共享配置代码：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">在支持的加载器之间保持单一的配置设置，减少重复并简化维护。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚡ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">原生支持时使用原生：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">在已内置所选配置系统的加载器上无需额外库，从而为用户最小化依赖。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/forgeconfigapiport/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客户端和服务端均需安装</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Fabric API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（对于 Fabric 版本）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/forgeconfigapiport/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感谢 Forge 和 NeoForge 团队创建并维护了本项目所基于的配置 API！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/forgeconfigapiport/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/eternal-nether\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/pick-up-notifier\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pickupnotifier/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fantastic-wings\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fantasticwings/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/forgeconfigapiport/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
